# TIER 1 - relaxed surface scan at GFN2-xTB (local laptop)
# Scan the bond being broken or formed. Examples for this project (ZERO-based indexing):
#   first Al-O cleavage (V-TS2, W-TS):    Scan B 0 1 = 1.75, 3.05, 14 end
#   chemisorption Al-O(V) (V-TS1):        Scan B 0 23 = 1.85, 3.05, 13 end
#   final Al-O cleavage (V-TS3):          Scan B 0 4 = 1.75, 3.05, 14 end
# Adjust atom numbers to the actual final XYZ file.

! XTB2 OPT

%pal nprocs 3 end

%geom
  Scan B 0 1 = 1.75, 3.05, 14 end
end

* xyzfile 0 1 input.xyz
